<title>SPAIN: Spain details Retevision bidding requirements.</title>
<headline>Spain details Retevision bidding requirements.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Official State Bulletin published details on Thursday of the upcoming privatisation of telecommunication firm Retevision, set to compete with Telefonica as Spain's second domestic telephone operator.</p>
<p>The upcoming bids must contain five parts: price, strategic plan, infrastructure, ability and experience of the bidder, and contribution to the domestic economy.</p>
<p>Under the system, the best price will be awarded with a maximum of 400 points, while the other criteria will be awarded between 100 and 200 points, the bulletin said.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
